     "solution_type": "detailed",
     "content_html": "<figure class=\"unnumbered\">\n<img src=\"https://exercises.openstax.org/rails/active_storage/blobs/proxy/eyJfcmFpbHMiOnsibWVzc2FnZSI6IkJBaHBBaWNHIiwiZXhwIjpudWxsLCJwdXIiOiJibG9iX2lkIn19--2b3f36a1f6b30fdd5eb0d8cfda06fb9b2e684db3/CS_Figure_08_02_037a.jpg\" alt=\"A bar graph titled, out-of-state costs at University of California campuses, unbiased. The horizontal axis represents campus. The vertical axis represents cost ranges from 0 to 45000, in increments of 5000. The bar graph infers the following data. Berkeley: 43,176. Davis: 43,394. Irvine: 42,692. Los Angeles: 42,218. Merced: 42,530. Riverside: 42,819. San Diego: 43,159. Santa Barbara: 43,383. Santa Cruz: 42,952. Note: all values are approximate.\">\n<figcaption>(data source: https://data.ed.gov/)</figcaption>\n</figure>\n\n<figure class=\"unnumbered\">\n<img src=\"https://exercises.openstax.org/rails/active_storage/blobs/proxy/eyJfcmFpbHMiOnsibWVzc2FnZSI6IkJBaHBBaWdHIiwiZXhwIjpudWxsLCJwdXIiOiJibG9iX2lkIn19--cd7c4f52fd6ec57d2772cd163e4055ea71c9a72a/CS_Figure_08_02_037b.jpg\" alt=\"A bar graph titled, out-of-state costs at University of California campuses, biased. The horizontal axis represents campus. The vertical axis represents cost ranges from 41600 to 43600, in increments of 200. The bar graph infers the following data. Berkeley: 43,176. Davis: 43,394. Irvine: 42,692. Los Angeles: 42,218. Merced: 42,530. Riverside: 42,819. San Diego: 43,159. Santa Barbara: 43,383. Santa Cruz: 42,952. Note: all values are approximate.\"><p></p><figcaption>(data source: https://data.ed.gov/)</figcaption>\n</figure>"
